-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("es",5,{
[129]="7005AB15\n1\tDefeat ice grims in the Welkin-lofts (total: 8)\tIce grims can be found on the cliffs near Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold. You should defeat ice grims.\n2\tTalk to Kyrstig\tKyrstig can be found near Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold. You should talk to Kyrstig.\n",
[130]="7003E571\n1\tInvestiga el origen de la sensación helada\tLa fuente del frío parece provenir de la zona suroeste de Nan Tornaeth. Debes investigar el origen de la sensación helada.\n2\tInvestiga el origen de la sensación helada\tLa fuente del frío parece provenir de la zona suroeste de Nan Tornaeth, no lejos del campamento de Calenthon. Debes investigar el origen de la sensación helada.\n3\tDerrota al oso espectral\tEl oso espectral tiene su guarida en la zona suroeste de Nan Tornaeth, no muy lejos del campamento de Calenthon. Debes derrotar al oso espectral; tal vez así liberes a los demás osos de su locura.\n4\tLleva el collar que encontraste a Calenthon\tCalenthon está en su campamento en Nan Tornaeth, al noreste de la guarida del oso espectral. Debes regresar con Calenthon y contarle tu victoria sobre el oso espectral.\n",
[131]="7002ED1D\n1\tReúne carne de uro (total: 5)\030Has reunido pieles de uro (total: 5)\030Has reunido marfil de uro (total: 5)\tSe pueden encontrar manadas de uros al sur y al este de Eaworth, en el Valle del Entaguas. Offram te ha pedido que caces uros para obtener carne, pieles y marfil.\n2\tLleva la carne, las pieles y el marfil de uro a Offram en Eaworth.\tOffram está de guardia fuera del Salón del Vendedor de Eaworth. Debes llevarle los objetos que has recogido.\n",
[132]="7005AAF8\n1\tFind Kyrstig near the Thing-fold\tKyrstig, the last of Ausma's scouts, can be found further up the Father's Path. You should find Kyrstig with Hórin.\n2\tTalk to Kyrstig by the Thing-fold\tYou have found Kyrstig near Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold. You should talk to Kyrstig.\n3\tTalk to Kyrstig by the Thing-fold and hear her report\tKyrstig is ready to give you her scouting report. You should talk to Kyrstig at Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold and complete 'Instance: A Clandestine Meeting'.\n4\tTalk to Hórin by the Thing-fold\tHórin can be found near Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold. You should talk to Hórin.\n5\tFind the entrance to the dwarf-fort of Bagud-dum\tKyrstig mentioned a dwarf-fort called Bagud-dum which seems to be the Angmarim's main base of operations in the Welkin-lofts. You should find Bagud-dum.\n6\tCall Hórin and talk to him\tHórin can be called with the summoning horn. You should talk to Hórin.\n",
[133]="7002ADEF\n1\tFind a top hat in Winter-home\030Find a scarf in Winter-home\030Find an acorn among the trees of Frostbluff\030Gather coal near the servants' oven\030Gather sticks from nearby bushes (total: 2)\tThe materials you need to replicate Virgil's snowman may be found around Frostbluff. In order to replicate Virgil's snowman, you will need to gather the right materials.\n2\tBuild a classy snowman at a snowpile\tThe snowman-field is outside of Winter-home. Now that you have gathered all of the necessary supplies, you should head to a snowpile to build your snowman.\n",
[134]="70071DEF\n1\tDerrota a las arañas en Jâr Obadal (total: 15)\030Prende fuego a las madrigueras cubiertas de telarañas en Jâr Obadal (total: 8)\tDerrota a las arañas dentro de Jâr Obadal y prende fuego a su red de telarañas.\n2\tEncuentra y derrota a Jûkhtar la Voraz en Jâr Obadal\tEncuentra y derrota a Jûkhtar la Voraz en Jâr Obadal.\n",
[135]="70044289\n1\tDefeat Sûhalar riders (total: 4)\tEasterling riders can be found in southern Talath Anor. You should defeat Easterling riders.\n2\tSpeak with Ingold\tIngold can be found at the northern gate of the Rammas. You should speak with Ingold.\n",
[136]="7001A4AC\n1\tDerrota a Carcharan en Gorotham\030Derrota a los murciélagos en Troncosombríos (total: 10)\030Recupera la bolsa robada\tPueden encontrarse murciélagos por todo Troncosombríos. Carcharan se encuentra en una cueva en Gorotham, al noreste de Echad Mothelen, más allá de Burgûl-stazg. Lavanferon te ha pedido que recuperes su bolsa perdida y derrotes a los murciélagos del Bosque Negro, incluyendo al vampiro Carcharan.\n2\tVuelve a ver a Lavanferon en Echad Mothelen\tLavanferon está en Echad Mothelen, al suroeste de Gorotham, más allá de Burgûl-stazg. Deberías devolver la bolsa a Lavanferon e informarle de tu victoria contra Carcharan.\n",
[137]="70047BDC\n1\tTalk to Legolas at Haerondir\tLegolas can be found on the north-western ramparts of Haerondir. Echil has asked you to speak to the Elves at Haerondir as their resolve has not visibly faltered. You should speak to Legolas first.\n2\tTalk to Elladan and Elrohir at Haerondir\tElladan and Elrohir can be found on the eastern ramparts at Haerondir. You have spoken to Legolas, but he has not experienced what Echil described. You should now speak to Elladan and Elrohir instead.\n",
[138]="7003495B\n1\tEncuentra el objeto en la casa abandonada de Iothete\tEl objeto del que habló Iothete se encuentra en su casa en Dunfast. Debes recoger el objeto cuando lo encuentres.\n2\tEncuentra el objeto en la casa abandonada de Iothete\tEl objeto del que habló Iothete se encuentra en su casa en Dunfast. Debes recoger el objeto cuando lo encuentres.\n3\tLleva la piedra fría a Iothete\tIothete está en su pequeña cabaña escondida en los bosques del norte de los Brezales Blancos. Debes llevar el fragmento de piedra que recogiste a Iothete como él pidió.\n",
[139]="700444A6\n1\tHabla con Egwylf fuera del Salón del Hidromiel de Cliving\tEgwylf está fuera del Salón del Hidromiel de Cliving, en las Campiñas del Norte.\n2\tEl agente desaparecido del Culto del Ojo Sangriento está en algún lugar de las Tierras Feroces.\t\n3\tExamina el cadáver del hombre desesperado, cerca de la Cumbre Solitaria\tEl cultista del Ojo Sangriento finalmente sucumbió a sus heridas y a los elementos cerca de la Cumbre Solitaria, en las Tierras Feroces.\n4\tLleva el broche del Ojo Sangriento a Egwylf en la ciudad de Forlaw\tEgwylf está en la ciudad de Forlaw, en las Tierras Feroces, al norte del maestro de establos. Has encontrado al cultista desaparecido del Ojo Sangriento y debes llevar el broche a Egwylf con la noticia de que ya no será una amenaza para Rohan.\n5\tHabla con Bingo en la ciudad de Forlaw\tBingo está en la ciudad de Forlaw, en las Tierras Feroces, al norte del maestro de establos.\n",
[140]="700683C4\n1\tCollect bog-lurker legs ([según el diario]/32)\030Collect bog-lurker seeds ([según el diario]/16)\tNorth in the hills beyond Umbar Baharbêl, you will find bog-lurkers nesting in the fields as you approach the shore. Hunt the bog-lurkers for their legs and seeds.\n2\tDeliver the seeds and legs to Luthana at the hunter's expedition\030Collect bog-lurker legs ([según el diario]/32)\030Collect bog-lurker seeds ([según el diario]/16)\tNorth in the hills beyond Umbar Baharbêl, you will find bog-lurkers nesting in the fields as you approach the shore. Hunt the bog-lurkers for their legs and seeds.\n",
[141]="700413D0\n1\tSpeak to Borhador\tBorhador can be found in his hall above Ethring village. Borhador asks you to investigate a sound he heard.\n2\tSpeak with Borhador\tBorhador can be found in his hall above Ethring village. You should speak with Borhador.\n3\tSpeak with Laerind\tLaerind can be found in Ethring village. You should speak with Laerind.\n",
[142]="7002EF6A\n1\tNada hasta el Acantilado, buscando señales de la presencia de Orcos\tEl Acantilado es la gran roca situada en el agua en la parte superior de las Cascadas de Rauros. Ramdir te pidió que nadaras hasta el Acantilado, buscando señales de la presencia de Orcos que buscan un pie sobre el roca supuestamente inaccesible.\n2\tHablar con Ramdir\tRamdir se encuentra en el campamento de Hestil en Parth Galen. Durante tu nado hasta el Acantilado, encontraste evidencia de que los Orcos no podrán conseguir un pie sobre la roca escarpada que se eleva sobre Rauros.\n",
[143]="7006B7A9\n1\tTake the broken wheel\tKhâmi has asked you to take their broken wheel to Iridír to have it repaired. You should pick up the waggon wheel.\n2\tBring the broken wheel to a wheelwright in Iridír\tYou have the broken waggon wheel. You should find someone in Iridír who can repair it.\n3\tComplete Quest: Mending the Wheel\tThe wheelwright, Aranbir, says he will make time to fix the waggon wheel if you fill in for his absent apprentice.\n4\tTake the repaired wheel\tYou have completed the work of the absent apprentice, and Aranbir says the wheel is repaired. You should pick up the wheel to bring it back to Khâmi at Gha Nêkha, the outpost in southern Ambarûl.\n5\tBring the repaired wheel to Khâmi\tYou have taken the broken wheel to Iridír and had it repaired. You should return it to Khâmi at Gha Nêkha, south-west of Eshadûr.\n",
[144]="7002C2D1\n1\tHabla con Ithamar sobre los orcos\030Habla con Nothelm sobre los orcos\030Habla con Hygerad sobre los orcos\tLos Rohirrim están acantonados en el campamento de Lanbert, cerca de la base del Cuthstan. Lanbert te ha pedido que hables con los demás soldados de su compañía y los convenzas de que la amenaza orca ya ha sido neutralizada.\n2\tHabla con Lanbert en el campamento del Cuthstan\tLanbert se encuentra en el campamento Rohirrim al pie del Cuthstan. Lanbert espera tu regreso con las armas útiles obtenidas de los orcos.\n3\tHabla con Odda al sur del Cuthstan\tPuedes encontrar a Odda al sur del Cuthstan, oculto al sur del camino. Lanbert te ha enviado a hablar con Odda.\n",
[145]="70055076\n1\tLost bands of Rangers might be found in the Circle of Death. Dolenthol has asked you to search for lost bands of Rangers who became separated after Gothmog's forces attacked Prince Faramir's company.\t\n2\tFind Dolenthal near Barad Cúron\tDolenthal told you to meet him before Barad Cúron, the Tower of the Crescent Moon, in the Circle of Death. You have aided the Rangers you found as best you could, and should now seek out Dolenthal near Barad Cúron.\n3\tTalk to Dolenthol\tDolenthol can be found before Barad Cúron, the Tower of the Crescent Moon, in the Circle of Death. You have rejoined Faramir's company. You should talk to Dolenthal.\n4\tHabla con Faramir\tFaramir can be found outside Uialrond, the Dome of Evening in the Circle of Death. Dolenthol has asked you to speak to Faramir.\n",
[146]="70017598\n1\tDerrota a Unur y a sus trols\tLa Sala Decimosexta se encuentra al norte de las Fundaciones de Piedra, justo al sur de Sigin-tharâk, y allí es donde puede hallarse el vociferador de maldiciones Unur. Celofa desea que hagas lo que ella no pudo: invocar a Unur con tu pergamino y derrotarlo en combate justo. Es probable que tenga compañeros, así que asegúrate de llevar aliados contigo en esta empresa.\n2\tRegresa junto a Celofa\tLa gran Rufián Celofa puede encontrarse en las Fundaciones de Piedra. Celofa espera noticias de tu aventura y desea enseñarte humildemente todo lo que sabe.\n",
[147]="700571E2\n1\tCollect carcasses from worms or avanc (total: 3)\tWorms and avanc can be found throughout Misthallow. You should defeat worms or avanc and gather their carcasses.\n2\tPlace the worm carcasses near Lumrog (cantidad: según el diario)\tStone slabs can be found around Lumrog in Misthallow. You should place the carcasses on the stone slabs.\n3\tTalk to Fanglind at Thokvist\tFanglind can be found at Thokvist. You should talk to Fanglind.\n4\tEnter Lumrog\tLumrog can be found in Misthallow. You should enter Lumrog.\n5\tSummon and confront Gúrbarash the chief of Lumrog\tLumrog can be found in Misthallow. You should find find and confront Gúrbarash in Lumrog.\n6\tTalk to Skarding Wargsbane at Thokvist\tSkarding can be found at Thokvist. You should talk to Skarding.\n",
[148]="7006C57F\n1\tReturn to Jirush and speak with Nangar about Amalíbi\tAmalíbi sent you to speak with Nangar about what you found and how best to proceed with this new knowledge. Return to Jirush and inform Nangar of all that transpired.\n2\tSpeak with Zidemel and learn what is needed for ink\tNangar believes Jombahok can be incited by Khârdu's words. He asks that you visit Zidemel to have the proper ink made to draft a curse from Khârdu toward Jombahok.\n3\tCollect drams of scorpion blood ([según el diario]/8)\tZidemel sent you to the quarry north-west of Jirush to collect drams of scorpion blood to distill and create ink to create a proper curse.\n4\tReturn the scorpion blood to Zidemel at Jirush\tYou acquired the eight drams of scorpion blood Zidemel needs to make the ink. Return the scorpion blood to Zidemel at Jirush.\n5\tSpeak with Malgat about the next steps\tZidemel sent you to Malgat. Find him at his hovel in Jirush.\n6\tCollect a bounty post written by Khârdu\tMalgat explained that Khârdu often pays travelling hunters bounties to clear beasts from the wastes of Khûd Zagin. He asks that you acquire a bounty posting and return it to him to validate Khârdu's handwriting.\n7\tAllow Malgat to confirm Khârdu wrote the posting\030Read the posting if you wish\tYou found a posting near the Ordâkhai encampment south and east from Jirush. You assume it is written by Khârdu. Return the bounty posting to Malgat for confirmation.\n8\tReturn to Nangar and show him the posting and ink\tMalgat confirmed the posting was written by Khârdu. He then directed you to deliver the ink and posting to Nangar for further instruction.\n9\tDeliver the ink and the posting to Galamê in Jirush\tNangar is pleased with all you have done. He requests that you take the ink and the posting to Galamê. Galamê will use the ink and posting to create an Ordâkhai curse in Khârdu's hand.\n10\tSpeak with Sûlmur to request a sheaf of her papyrus\tGalamê states he can replicate Khârdu's writing. The papyrus he has, however, is not the same quality as Khârdu uses, and to make the curse authentic he needs papyrus from the farmer, Sûlmur in Ambarûl.\n11\tDeliver the sheaf of papyrus to Galamê\tSûlmur provided you with a sheaf of papyrus and asked for Galamê's patronage. She then pledged her sword and asked you to request the swords of Khûd Zagin, should they overcome their Ordâkhai oppressors.\n12\tDeliver the inciting letter to Nangar\tGalamê returns a letter to you written in Ordâkhin. He tells you it will incite violence between the two captains and asks that you deliver it to Nangar.\n13\tDeliver the inciting letter to Amalíbi at Ghalbûru\tNangar trusts the efforts of the other elders and appreciates your role in acquiring the letter. He puts his faith in you and the other elders and sends you to Amalíbi for the final decision.\n",
[149]="70044290\n1\tFind the area where the sheep are grazing in Pelennor\tSheep can be found grazing in the south-western corner of Pelennor Fields. You should find and return the sheep to Talfadan.\n2\tHerd grazing sheep back to the farm (total: 6)\030Defeat Morgul scouts (total: 6)\tSheep and Morgul Scouts can be found grazing in the south-western corner of Pelennor Fields. You should find and return the sheep to Talfadan as well as defeat the Morgul Scouts.\n3\tSpeak with Talfadan\tTalfadan is at Pel Dúven. You should speak with Talfadan.\n4\tSpeak with Turgon\tTurgon can be found at the South-gate of the Rammas. You should speak with Turgon.\n",
[150]="70030814\n1\tQuema tiendas orcas (total: 6)\tSe pueden encontrar tiendas dentro de los campamentos orcos al norte y al sur de Walstow.\n2\tCompletado\tGracias a tus esfuerzos, los campamentos orcos arden brillantemente. Esto seguramente es una señal de mejores días por venir para Walstow.\n",
[151]="7003B48B\n1\tHabla con el Thane Cútha\tEl Thane Cútha se encuentra en el Salón del Hidromiel de la Atalaya de la Almenara. Armado con más información sobre los Orcos de la tribu del Jabalí, proporcionada por el propio hijo de Cútha, debes hablar una vez más con el Thane de la Atalaya de la Almenara.\n2\tHabla con Meregyth\tMeregyth se encuentra cerca del Salón del Hidromiel de la Atalaya de la Almenara. Cútha se mantuvo firme en su posición y no vaciló. Sin embargo, dio permiso a Cúthing para ayudar en la medida de sus posibilidades. Debes informar a Meregyth de la desafortunada noticia.\n",
[152]="7002FCF1\n1\tFinge ser un espantapájaros en los campos de Garsfeld (total: 6)\030Derrota a los crebain confundidos (total: 8)\tAl ver destruidos a los demás, Agelric de Garsfeld quiere que atraigas a los crebain fingiendo ser un espantapájaros en los campos que rodean Garsfeld.\n2\tHabla con Agelric\tLos crebain han quedado completamente sorprendidos por el ardid de Agelric. Deberías informarle de tu éxito. Agelric se encuentra en el centro de Garsfeld.\n",
[153]="700216EF\n1\tRecoge la falsa Cosecha del Brandivino en El Pájaro y el Bebé\tCarlo Bosqueoscuro se encuentra en El Pájaro y el Bebé, en Cavada Grande. Deberías recoger un Viejo Los Vientos en El Pájaro y el Bebé, que serán entregadas a Saerthuithel disfrazadas como Vino del Brandivino.\n2\tLleva la falsa Cosecha del Brandivino a Saerthuithel en Echad Candelleth\tSaerthuithel se encuentra en Echad Candelleth, en el Bosque de los Trolls. Deberías llevarle el Viejo Los Vientos, hábilmente disfrazadas como Vino del Brandivino, lo antes posible.\n",
[154]="7001B241\n1\tHabla con Miluimil para viajar a las cuevas\tMiluimil se encuentra en el campamento de Ivorel en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas. Miluimil te ha pedido que viajes con él a las cuevas del norte de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas e impidas que los sirvientes de Dol Guldur capturen a Gollum.\n2\tHabla con Miluimil en el campamento de Ivorel\tMiluimil se encuentra en el campamento de Ivorel en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas. Deberías hablar con Miluimil sobre la huida de Gollum.\n",
[155]="7003FDE7\n1\tTalk to Calennen in Alagrant\tCalennen can be found in the village of Alagrant to the south-west of Morlad. Malthellam has asked you to scout for threats to the south and ensure the safety of the people in the villages of Alagrant and Sardol.\n",
[156]="7004DA63\n1\tCollect 'healing draughts' for ailing Stout-axes (total: 8)\030Collect dried cloaks for ailing Stout-axes (total: 4)\tDried cloaks can be found near various fire-pits and forges in the Hall Under the Mountain. 'Healing draughts' can be found on feasting tables in the Hall Under the Mountain. Náth hopes to help ailing Stout-axes by giving them 'healing draughts' and the warmth of a dried cloak.\n2\tAiling Stout-axes can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have gathered 'healing draughts' and dried cloaks for the ailing Stout-axes and should now deliver them.\t\n3\tCompletado\tYou have aided the ailing Stout-axes.\n",
[157]="70058C83\n1\tTalk to Múta\tMúta can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower at the centre of Caivád Sâr. After learning that a ruthless dwarf-lord named Brathar leads the Dourhands at Caivád Sâr, Múta has resolved to defeat this mysterious, new leader for the good of the Gabil'akkâ.\n2\tTalk to Múta outside Caivád Sâr\tMúta can be found outside of Caivád Sâr in the War of Three Peaks. You were able to escape Tûr Ágal after learning of Brathar Crack-helm and the Dourhands' plans. You should talk to Múta.\n",
[158]="70029B2A\n1\tDerrota a los ingenieros trasgos (total: 10)\tEs posible que puedas llegar al conjunto de dispositivos a través de la red de extraños tubos que parecen atravesar la zona. Dagoras te pidió que derrotaras a los ingenieros trasgos que trabajan en el gran dispositivo de Saruman en la grieta debajo del distrito oeste de Isengard.\n2\tHabla con Dagoras dentro del Anillo de Isengard\tDagoras se esconde dentro del Anillo de Isengard. Debes regresar con Dagoras con noticias de tu éxito.\n",
[159]="700169CE\n1\tLos trasgos y orcos están atacando el espejo, intentando destruirlo.\t\n2\tHabla con Kúli en Guardia Orca\tKúli está en Guardia Orca. El enano Kúli estará interesado en esaber que el espejo está todavía a salvo.\n",
[160]="7005A56D\n1\tCheck the area\tMekhnet has been keeping an eye on the opposite shoreline to the east of the the Kambráda encampment in Amdân. You should check to see if anything strange is happening there.\n2\tExamine the bomb\tYou have found nothing of note other than an inert sapper-bomb. Perhaps inspecting it will unlock more clues.\n3\tTalk to Mekhnet\tMekhnet waits near the Kambráda encampment in the eastern part of Amdân. She will want to hear about the goblin-sapper and the bomb you found.\n",
})
